      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T12:50:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is the rational about this?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 385,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 385,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "0e3cc86f31f91cf10ae0c1da6616ecb6d1e69276",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9da0e326_f97466d0",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/alloc.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 385,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-15T17:37:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is because we _always_ have the following stack order\n\n```\n...\nchunk_hdr\n\nunmaped_region\nmapped_region\nallocated_region\nchunk_hdr\n```\n\nOne chunk can _not_ have a stack of mapped_region/unmapped_region/mapped_region.\n\nSo to be able to reclaim pages in the middle of the heap, a chunk must be installed in the following page not reclaimed. \n\nKeeping enough space at the start of a page make sure we can install that chunk.",
      "parentUuid": "dbf969c5_fea6e340",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 385,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 385,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "0e3cc86f31f91cf10ae0c1da6616ecb6d1e69276",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dd56dd40_e077565f",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/alloc.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 385,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-15T19:04:49Z",
