      "message": "Done",
      "parentUuid": "9da0e326_f97466d0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 385,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 385,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "0e3cc86f31f91cf10ae0c1da6616ecb6d1e69276",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "57636320_49e5a053",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/alloc.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 423,
      "author": {
        "id": 1965911
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T12:50:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is the new chunk involved, don\u0027t we just need `chunk_size(size)`?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 423,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 423,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "0e3cc86f31f91cf10ae0c1da6616ecb6d1e69276",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4bb58da1_9cff71d8",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kvm/hyp/nvhe/alloc.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 423,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-15T17:37:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because we want also to install a new chunk, so we want (chunk_size(size) + enough space to install the new chunk)\n\nThat space corresponds to the delta between the end of the new chunk header and the end of the current chunk header.",
      "parentUuid": "57636320_49e5a053",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 423,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 423,
        "endChar": 18
      },
      "revId": "0e3cc86f31f91cf10ae0c1da6616ecb6d1e69276",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
